            "review_title": "Review at Cha Ca Tan Tan",
            "review_text": "Henk de B.\nNew York City, New York33 contributions\n0\nHidden entrance and authentic\nNov 2018\nWe were brought here by a local and the majority of people there were local. The food was very tasty and inexpensive. We did not get the Cha Ca but I let my friends order. Everything that came out tasted like a home cooked meal.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 7, 2018",
